WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.900
In a project, go down to Recurring

2
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.500
Tap Add Recurring

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.300
Name what repeats

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.800
Every week is already set — pick the day

5
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.300
The schedule reads back in words

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.800
Add

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.300
It sits under Recurring and comes back every Friday

8
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.900
To stop it for a while, open it…

9
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.600
…tap ⋯…

10
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.100
…and Pause recurrence

11
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:50.600
Paused — until you resume it
